PostgreSQL: psql and libpq
------------------------------------------------------------------------

Parliament's Postgres shell is built to behave as psql does, and parts of
it are ports of PostgreSQL's client code: psql (src/bin/psql), its
printing and string utilities (src/fe_utils), libpq
(src/interfaces/libpq) and src/common. These parts reproduce psql's
catalog queries and messages. They live chiefly in
tyto/src/plane/postgres.rs, tyto/src/plane/postgres/, tyto/src/psql_*.rs,
tyto/src/parser.rs, noctua/src/locale.rs and noctua/src/pgpass.rs, and
